@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<https://www.glossarist.org/dpp/dataset/dpp/concept/dpp-0111>
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:notation "dpp-0111" ;
  skos:prefLabel "property"@eng ;
  skos:definition "defined characteristic suitable for the description and differentiation of products or components"@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "The concept of type and instance applies to properties."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "This definition applies to properties as described in IEC 61360/ ISO 13584-42."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "The property types are defined in dictionaries (like IEC component data dictionary or ECLASS), they do not have a value. The property type is also called data element type in some standards."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "The property instances have a value and are provided by the manufacturers. A property instance is also called property-value pair in certain standards."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "Properties include nominal value, actual value, runtime variables, measurement values, etc."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "A property describes one characteristic of a given object."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "The specification of a property can include predefined choices of values."@eng
 .